    "tactics": "Mud Grubs burrow under enemies and attack from below, attempting to grapple and use Drag Under to immobilize. Useful for pinning a single target rather than dealing meaningful damage.",
    "attacksNotes": "<p>Bite [Combat]: Melee attack (Agil 5 + Melee Combat 1), Reach: 5 ft</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 5 damage (3 + 2 Str)</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 5 damage, DR halved (round up)</li>\n</ul>",
    "specialAbilitiesNotes": "<p>Burrowing: Can move through earth and loose stone at its burrow speed. Movement through solid rock is not possible. Drag Under: When the Mud Grub successfully grapples a creature that is standing on earth or soil, the creature sinks 1 foot into the ground. A sinking creature gains the Restrained condition until it pulls free (Might or Athletics check, Hard task).</p>",
